.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.9:
	.ascii	"a wrong index, possibly a live one \342\200\224 double-issuing it"
	.size	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.9, 56

	.type	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.10,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.10,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.10:
	.ascii	"the EMPTY SENTINEL, leaking the whole remaining chain"
	.size	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.10, 53

	.type	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.11,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.11,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.11:
	.asciz	"\nload_next(\300\013) returned \301 \000\200`$, neither TAIL nor a valid index (< \301 \000\200`=): pop_index's truncating pack would silently truncate it to \300"
	.size	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.11, 135

	.type	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.12,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.12,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.12:
	.asciz	"\nload_next(\300\013) returned \301 \000\200`\200\272\000, the index's own link points back to itself \342\200\224 a self-loop, corrupting the free-list into a cycle: pop_index's truncating pack would silently re-issue this same index to a second owner"
	.size	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.12, 219

	.type	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.13,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.13,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.13:
	.asciz	"Aindex must be < INDEX_MASK (the empty sentinel is reserved), got \300\017 (INDEX_MASK = \301 \000\200`\001)"
	.size	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.13, 91

	.type	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.14,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.14,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.14:
	.ascii	"tagged-index-stack: push refused, the head's tag has reached TaggedIndex::TAG_MAX; the stack is sealed (pops still work, pushes are refused permanently)"
	.size	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.14, 152

	.type	.Lanon.80218f0228f19c236ca46168eda683aa.15,@object
